    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About this game</h2>Before you buy your first place to grow your business, you have to work hard for it. But don't worry, you already have all the necessary tools for the job in your apartment, because you have completed a certain journalism project for which they were needed. As you develop your career path, you will be moving to larger and larger offices that you need to clean and renovate first, and then hire employees with the appropriate qualifications to help you expand your business and earn more money for yourself. Remember to be careful when publishing your articles about individuals around the world, because in the future, positive or negative relationships with those individuals can bring both advantages and disadvantages.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/84aff5c5a5050f55785ed06dc19306a9.poster.avif?t=1709036974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/84aff5c5a5050f55785ed06dc19306a9.webm?t=1709036974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/00cdc0e8d5c3e46bd20f49b5d381a310.poster.avif?t=1709036974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/00cdc0e8d5c3e46bd20f49b5d381a310.webm?t=1709036974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play your way</h2>It is YOU who choose your career path and YOU decide what direction it will take. When building articles, you can choose the type of your statement, whether it will be negative or positive, everything depends on you. Be sure to publish your newspapers wisely as they may have different results in the future.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/4b1d18f6672a8b9b08ebddc0bbfb33ff.poster.avif?t=1709036974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/4b1d18f6672a8b9b08ebddc0bbfb33ff.webm?t=1709036974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build your empire</h2>With the right amount of money, you will be able to move to your new dream office, which you first need to clean up and renovate to be able to start working there properly and hire your employees.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/77987d76f9c832c22cfa5a872bae0214.poster.avif?t=1709036974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/77987d76f9c832c22cfa5a872bae0214.webm?t=1709036974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/3dcb8d44474101621b752b4b035f064a.poster.avif?t=1709036974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/3dcb8d44474101621b752b4b035f064a.webm?t=1709036974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/60fb03f60e9bacd88d2ad4ebc6f132d7.poster.avif?t=1709036974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/60fb03f60e9bacd88d2ad4ebc6f132d7.webm?t=1709036974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Think, then do</h2>Try to work smart, not hard. Leave trivial and easy articles for your employees to work on, and choose the heavy ones, which can directly and strongly affect your career and opinion in the world, for yourself. Remember that the chosen path has given perks, so think twice which direction you will choose. In one, you have a chance to earn more money, and in the other, fans, while the decision is up to you and your preferences, which in your opinion is more important and has greater potential.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/fb7a6dafa299931a3e869f26b60cbc0e.poster.avif?t=1709036974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/fb7a6dafa299931a3e869f26b60cbc0e.webm?t=1709036974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rest</h2>Later in the game, rest will become your job, so you can focus on other activities. Employed employees will start making various articles for you, and thanks to this, you will have free time for yourself, which you can spend on managing the company, developing it with new opportunities, or leaving time for rest or entertainment, which will make your time spent more pleasant.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/8605b918955d1e7037f3d9a8cc4f35f0.poster.avif?t=1709036974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083000/extras/8605b918955d1e7037f3d9a8cc4f35f0.webm?t=1709036974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
